yt-dlp
------
Role: video helper. scripts/fetch-helpers.sh fetches the pinned macOS
binary. The app launches that binary and does not run self-update. ffmpeg
is still not shipped.
License: Unlicense
The pinned release is yt-dlp_macos, a PyInstaller build. That build also
includes other third-party licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt in the
pinned yt-dlp tag.
Project: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
Pinned version and checksum: helpers/yt-dlp.lock

ffmpeg
------
Role: remux only, not in v1. Not fetched and not shipped. Video downloads
use a single-file format selector and do not merge streams.
License: LGPL

Sparkle
-------
Role: app updates. The app links Sparkle 2.9.6 through Swift Package Manager.
The framework is not vendored in this repo. The Mac release script signs
Sparkle's XPC services, Updater.app, and Autoupdate with Developer ID.
License: MIT
Project: https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle
